                   (f", autopilot={st['autopilot']}" if "autopilot" in st else "") + " (`rival` in the record).")
    plan = "\n".join("- " + p for p in rec["plan"]) or "- no planner line recorded"
    return f"""# Duel in one game: planned bot vs {b_name} (seed {rec['seed']}, {rec['months']} months)

Generated by `tools/research/mcp-duel`{(' (' + label + ')') if label else ''}. One game, one map: company 1 is PrismaticAI started from
the planner's portfolio (by the panel){(' with extra settings ' + bot_settings) if bot_settings else ''}, company 2 {('the same AI started without a plan' if opponent == 'PrismaticAI' else opponent + ' with its own defaults')} right after it.
Both compete for the same towns and industries. {values}

